{"version":1,"id":"sam-hunt-take-your-time","title":"Take Your Time","artist":"Sam Hunt","key":"B","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/sam-hunt/take-your-time/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Shane McAnally, Josh Osborne and Sam Hunt","chords":[{"symbol":"G#m","canonical":"G#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,11,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#m","canonical":"C#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Ebm","canonical":"Ebm","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,6,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"Intro:","columns":17,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":14,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't know if you were looking at me or not, You probably smile like that all the time","columns":88,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"And I don't mean to bother you but I couldn't just walk by, And not say hi","columns":74,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":37,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"And I know your name, 'cause everybody in here knows your name,","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"And you're not looking for anything right now","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"So I don't wanna come on strong, don't get me wrong Your eyes are so intimidating","columns":81,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"My heart is pounding but, It's just a conversation, No girl I'm not gunna waste it","columns":82,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"You don't know me, I don't know you but I want to","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"section","text":"Chorus:","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna steal your freedom, I don't wanna change your mind","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ebm","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't have to make you love me, I just want to take your time","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna wreck your Friday, I ain't gunna waste my lies","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ebm","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't have to take your heart, I just wanna take your time","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"And I know it starts with hello, And the next thing you know you're trying to be nice","columns":85,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"And some guys getting too close","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Tryin to pick you up, Trying to get you drunk","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm sure one of your friends is about to come over here","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Cuz she's supposed to save you from random guys","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"That talk to much and wanna stay too long, It's the same old song and dance but I think you know","columns":96,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":" it","columns":3,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"well","columns":4,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"You coulda rolled your eyes, Told me to go to hell, Coulda walked away","columns":70,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"But your still here, And I'm still here, Come on let's see where it goes","columns":72,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"section","text":"Chorus:","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna steal your freedom, I don't wanna change your mind","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ebm","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't have to make you love me, I just wanna take your time","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't have to meet your mother, We don't have to cross that line","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ebm","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna steal your covers, I just wanna take your time","columns":60,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"G#m","column":44,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"Whoa, Whoa, Whoa","columns":16,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":6,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna go ho